    `the item`                                                                             IS `an item not in the Schedule`
    `what the property is`                                                                 IS `the contract works or other property of an ordinary kind`
    `physical loss or damage`                                                              IS TRUE
    `sudden and unforeseen`                                                                IS TRUE
    `to an extent that requires repair or replacement`                                     IS TRUE
    `the causes`                                                                           IS LIST (`a cause the policy does not name, namely` "storm")
    `discovered only when an inventory was taken`                                          IS FALSE
    `the damaged part had been handed over before the occurrence`                          IS FALSE
    `the damaged part had been put into use before the occurrence`                         IS FALSE
    `damaged in an earlier occurrence and not then repaired properly without delay`        IS FALSE
    `the state after the occurrence`                                                       IS `repairable, at a necessary cost of` 400_000_000
    `the actual value immediately before the occurrence`                                   IS 6_000_000_000
    `the value of salvage`                                                                 IS 0
    `the cost the Insured has actually incurred in repairing or replacing it`              IS 400_000_000
    `of which, alterations, additions or improvements`                                     IS 0
    `of which, overtime, night work, holiday work or express freight`                      IS 0
    `of which, provisional repairs not part of the final repairs or increasing their cost` IS 0
    `of which, replacing, repairing or rectifying defective material or workmanship`       IS 0
    `the part of the loss not included in the sum insured`                                 IS 0
    `the invoices and documents showing the repair or replacement were produced`           IS TRUE
